#: src/Support/OrganizerGuide.php:304
msgid "📰 The next events announcement, if an administrator has switched it on, emails the coming events to everyone who joined it. Before it goes out, each organizer gets a preview email with a button to stop it; the Crew app Admin tab has the same button. To add your own text to the next announcement, send /newsletter followed by the text in a private chat with the bot, or tell the bot there in your own words what to add (it shows the text with a Confirm button first), or use the Admin tab. Write it in any language: it is translated into every site language."
msgstr ""

#: src/Telegram/SayCommand.php:307
