msgid "🤍 Thanks for letting us know about %1$s. Telling the crew is always better than not showing up.\n\nIt was a late cancellation: early notice gives someone else time to take the place. %2$s%3$s\n\n%4$s It weighs less over time. Next time may suit you better, so sign up again! If this is a mistake, tell an organizer."
