msgid "🤍 We missed you at %1$s. Unexpected things happen, and that's OK.\n\nThe night runs on its crew: a missed task falls on others or leaves a gap. %2$s%3$s\n\nA no-show counts against your standing; every task you complete lifts it again. Next time may suit you better, so sign up again! If this is a mistake, tell an organizer."
